        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Heavy Duty Door Saver Hold Open Arm with Cush-N-Stop</b>\r\n<p>\r\nT-Bar style Cush-N-Stop Hold Open arm for use with <a href=\"/products/ada-compliant-heavy-duty-door-closer-global-tc4361\"><b>Global TC4361</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/tc201-global-grade-1-surface-mount-door-closer\"><b>Global TC201</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/tc411-ada-compliant-grade-1-tri-packed-door-closer\"><b>Global TC411</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/tc412-grade-1-tri-packed-door-closer\"><b>Global TC412</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/ada-compliant-full-cover-tri-packed-door-closer\"><b>Global TC511</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/grade-1-full-cover-door-closer\"><b>Global TC512</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/ada-compliant-grade-1-tri-packed-door-closer-global-tc611\"><b>Global TC611</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/grade-1-tri-packed-door-closer-global-tc612\"><b>Global TC612</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Parallel Arm Mount Only. \r\n<br>\r\n(**For 12 mm square closer shaft).</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Heavy duty rigid arm assembly and soffit plate with field reversible dead stop. \"T\" bar turn knob to activated or inactivate the hold open function. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n Available in 2 finishes of Aluminum or Dark Bronze .\r\n</p>",
